AFGCN decision solver

The root README documents the tested Python 3.11 CPU environment, supported
tasks and input format. Install dependencies from requirements-cpu.txt there.

From the repository root:
  python Solver/solver.py --filepath Solver/testaf1.txt --task DC-CO --argument 1

The Bash adapter is:
  bash Solver/solver.sh -p DC-CO -f Solver/testaf1.txt -a 1 -fo i23

The supported format is a "p af N" header followed by numeric attack pairs.
Use --help, --formats and --problems to inspect the adapter.
